Conflicts: gnome-session-common
Description: CDOS Session Manager - common files
 The CDOS Session Manager is in charge of starting the core components
 of the CDOS desktop, and applications that should be launched at
 login time. It also features a way to save and restore currently
 running applications.
 .
 This package contains the translations, data files and startup scripts
 which are common to the CDOS and CDOS fallback sessions.
